request.description:
GET /api/doctor/patient/{id}  [PROTECTED]

Retrieve full medical record of a specific patient (profile + clinical info).

**Response 200:**
```json
{
  "patient": { PatientDTO },
  "clinicalInfo": { PatientClinicalInforDTO }
}
```
If no clinical info exists, an empty DTO with `patientId` is returned.

